{"identity_key": "bilibili:1262617307987836949", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1262617307987836949", "content": "由Lain Artificia开发的黑白风恐怖视觉小说《Kusari Doi: In October The Rain Never Stopped [VOL 1]》現已上架JAST Store，开放完全免费可下载！(目前仅支持英文）\n\nhttps://jaststore.com/zh_Hans/games/Lain001\n\n喜欢的玩家也可以到开发者的主页或ko-fi支持他们！\n⬛⬜⬛⬜⬛⬜⬛⬜⬛⬜⬛⬜\n故事讲述Jin Kinoshita 在过去的八年里，一直生活在他拼命希望不会到来的那一天的阴影下……他最好的朋友的死亡。他在一家破旧的快餐店为最低工资苦干，勉强付得起房租，成为职业艺术家的梦想缓慢而痛苦地死去。完全失去了目标，他任由自己所有的才华像摊开手掌中的沙子一样从指缝间溜走。\n\n十月初的雨将无数回忆冲刷到 Jin 脑海的最前方。在他曾试图忘记的过去的鼓励下，他决心再次为自己的梦想冒险。在重拾生活碎片的过程中，在新老朋友们的激励下，他们决定一起蹚过齐腰深的水，踏上康复之旅。", "publisher": "JASTUSA_官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1262617307987836949", "published_at": "2026-10-24T04:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T15:28:00.435009+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/ca3785848a353f6950da2d53a43165f61436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d0c6a822e5b89a57e502d1c7cc1eb4271436152920.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/78e5ac35a333a70128aac3e857f684c51436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/0cfa5ddb4658cf312edc7feb155f25f91436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/e09520c1631cbd72f573b3aff92915401436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d9bdfd1881d385ac3ae5f134db19b2ac1436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5efd96d6ee2059941682c1d91d4c081a1436152920.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/e628d62e5e4501afadb929206278c7ed1436152920.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/2403d9fb92b1205253a6756a13e027e01436152920.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_1436152920", "uid": "1436152920", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 19, "retweets": 0, "repli